 public class Bridge{@JavascriptInterface public void sendOtp(String p){runOnUiThread(()->send(p));}@JavascriptInterface public void verifyOtp(String c){runOnUiThread(()->verify(c));}@JavascriptInterface public void placeOrder(String n,String p,String ad,String i,int s){runOnUiThread(()->order(n,p,ad,i,s,""));}@JavascriptInterface public void placeOrderWithCoupon(String n,String p,String ad,String i,int s,String c){runOnUiThread(()->order(n,p,ad,i,s,c));}@JavascriptInterface public void loadLastOrder(){runOnUiThread(()->loadLast());}@JavascriptInterface public void cancelLastOrder(){runOnUiThread(()->{String id=getPreferences(0).getString("lastOrderId",null);if(id!=null&&a.getCurrentUser()!=null)db.collection("orders").document(id).get().addOnSuccessListener(d->{if(a.getCurrentUser().getUid().equals(d.getString("userId"))&&"PLACED".equals(d.getString("status")))db.collection("orders").document(id).update("status","CANCELLED");});});}@JavascriptInterface public void getLocation(){runOnUiThread(()->locate());}@JavascriptInterface public void getOrderHistory(){runOnUiThread(()->history());}@JavascriptInterface public void getProfile(){runOnUiThread(()->profile());}@JavascriptInterface public void saveProfile(String n,String p){runOnUiThread(()->saveProfile(n,p));}@JavascriptInterface public void getAddresses(){runOnUiThread(()->addresses());}@JavascriptInterface public void saveAddress(String l,String ad){runOnUiThread(()->saveAddress(l,ad));}@JavascriptInterface public void submitReview(String id,int r,String c){runOnUiThread(()->review(id,r,c));}@JavascriptInterface public void checkAdmin(){runOnUiThread(()->adminCheck());}@JavascriptInterface public void adminOrders(){runOnUiThread(()->adminOrders());}@JavascriptInterface public void updateOrderStatus(String id,String st){runOnUiThread(()->status(id,st));}}
